 "system": {
  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Earth Manipulation — Cursed Technique Reversal, 11th level</em></p><p>At 11th level, as an action for 1 CE you can target a small non-magical object made of earth, stone, or metal and turn it to dust. If a creature is holding it, they can make a Dexterity saving throw to dodge your touch. At 6th level, you can use this on a cursed tool of Second Grade or lower for 2 CE. If you touch it, it gains a -1 to attack and damage rolls if it is a weapon or AC if it is armor (first reducing the tool’s bonuses if any). If this penalty reaches -3, the item disintegrates into dust. At 11th level this can affect first grade tools for 3 CE, at 18th level it can affect special grades for 6 CE.</p>",
   "chat": ""
  },
